# Messaging Constitution

Read and obey `harness/constitutions/messaging.md`.

- RabbitMQ + async (`aio-pika`); hexagonal publishers/consumers.
- Versioned envelopes; at-least-once + consumer idempotency; outbox for business facts.
- Naming: `ex.*`, `q.<service>.*`, routing keys `<context>.<entity>.<event>.vN`.
- DLQ + bounded retries; no broker-as-database.
